### Health Check
GET localhost:8080/api/health

### GET TrackedObjects by ID
GET localhost:8080/api/tracked-objects/2

### GET request for all tracked objects
GET localhost:8080/api/tracked-objects

### GET only hazardous objects
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tracked-objects/hazardous

### GET Filter: nur gefährliche
GET localhost:8080/api/tracked-objects?hazardous=true

### GET Filter: nur ungefährliche
GET localhost:8080/api/tracked-objects?hazardous=false

### GET by ID (404)
GET localhost:8080/api/tracked-objects/999

### GET count tracked-objects
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tracked-objects/count

### GET info-text
GET http://localhost:8080/api/info

### PUT - Objekt vollständig ersetzen
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/tracked-objects/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "2024 YR4 (revised)",
  "estimatedDiameterKm": 0.098,
  "potentiallyHazardous": true,
  "closeApproachDate": "2032-12-24",
  "missDistanceKm": 3100000.0
}

### POST - neues Objekt anlegen
POST http://localhost:8080/api/tracked-objects
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Eros",
  "estimatedDiameterKm": 16.34,
  "potentiallyHazardous": false,
  "closeApproachDate": "2065-10-25",
  "missDistanceKm": 26000000.0
}

### DELETE noch-da Objekt - 204 (1. Aufruf)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/tracked-objects/3

### DELETE nicht-mehr-da Objekt - 404 (2. Aufruf)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/tracked-objects/3

### PATCH - Hazardous-Status umschalten (1. Aufruf)
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/tracked-objects/1/hazardous

### PATCH - Hazardous-Status umschalten (2. Aufruf)
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/tracked-objects/1/hazardous


### GET hazardous: nur gefährliche Objekte (eigener Pfad)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tracked-objects/hazardous

### SEARCH: Namen mit "apo" (case-insensitive, sollte Apophis finden)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tracked-objects/search?name=apo

### SEARCH: Namen mit "BENNU" (sollte trotzdem Bennu finden - IgnoreCase!)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tracked-objects/search?name=BENNU

### SEARCH: ungültiger Name (sollte leere Liste zurückgeben, 200 OK)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tracked-objects/search?name=xxxxxxx

### SEARCH: ohne Parameter -> 400 Bad Request
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tracked-objects/search


### GET large: Asteroiden mit Durchmesser > 0.3 km
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tracked-objects/large

###############################
### Observations (1:n)
###############################

### GET alle Beobachtungen für Apophis (id=2)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tracked-objects/2/observations

### POST: erste Beobachtung für Apophis anlegen
POST http://localhost:8080/api/tracked-objects/2/observations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "observerName": "Katrin Schaake",
  "observedAt": "2029-04-13T22:00:00",
  "location": "Ravensburg",
  "notes": "Sehr heller Durchgang, mit bloßem Auge sichtbar"
}

### POST: zweite Beobachtung für Apophis
POST http://localhost:8080/api/tracked-objects/2/observations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "observerName": "Max Mustermann",
  "observedAt": "2029-04-14T23:15:00",
  "location": "München",
  "notes": "Leicht bewölkt, aber gut erkennbar"
}

### GET wieder: jetzt sollten 2 Beobachtungen da sein
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tracked-objects/2/observations

### POST: Parent existiert nicht -> 404
POST http://localhost:8080/api/tracked-objects/9999/observations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "observerName": "Test",
  "observedAt": "2029-01-01T10:00:00",
  "location": "Nirgendwo",
  "notes": "Sollte 404 sein"
}

### POST: 400 Bad Request + fieldErrors im Body
POST http://localhost:8080/api/tracked-objects
Content-Type: application/json

{
"name": "",
"estimatedDiameterKm": 0,
"potentiallyHazardous": false,
"closeApproachDate": "abc",
"missDistanceKm": -100
}

### DELETE auf nicht existierender ID - 404 not found
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/tracked-objects/9999

### NASA Test GET
GET localhost:8080/api/neo/today

### NASA Test Import (macht man sonst nicht!)
POST localhost:8080/api/neo/import
